{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01866","headline":"杂曲歌辞 秦女卷衣 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 秦女卷衣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天子居未央，妾侍卷衣裳。\n顾无紫宫宠，敢拂黄金牀。\n水至亦不去，熊来尚可当。\n微身奉日月，飘若萤火光。\n愿君采葑菲，无以下体妨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01866.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01866","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}